(5522182, 797561, 106726, '<td valign="top">i find the man on the far right a bit distracting. otherwise, i love this shot</td>', 'i find the man on the far right a bit distracting. otherwise, i love this shot', '2009-06-10 04:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522193, 797145, 16929, '<td valign="top">I''ve driven by this on the I-5 in San Diego. When my nephews were young, I screamed DISNEYLAND while we drove by. They were flipping out. LOL it was hilarious. Nice capture. It''s hard to photograph this building because there''s so much crap around it: the apartments, the freeway, gates, etc.</td>', 'I''ve driven by this on the I-5 in San Diego. When my nephews were young, I screamed DISNEYLAND while we drove by. They were flipping out. LOL it was hilarious. Nice capture. It''s hard to photograph this building because there''s so much crap around it: the apartments, the freeway, gates, etc.', '2009-06-10 04:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522216, 796873, 66515, '<td valign="top">I would have moved to either move the lamp out of the scene entirely or at least position it so it wasn''t right in front and center of the scene. And um...tried to get more of the actual building in the shot too.</td>', 'I would have moved to either move the lamp out of the scene entirely or at least position it so it wasn''t right in front and center of the scene. And um...tried to get more of the actual building in the shot too.', '2009-06-10 04:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522263, 796964, 66515, '<td valign="top">With the flat white sky, I am curious if converting to monochrome would be a good approach</td>', 'With the flat white sky, I am curious if converting to monochrome would be a good approach', '2009-06-10 05:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522265, 797608, 66515, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if the sepia toning works for this subject as sepia usually implies age (the building itself feels futuristic in my opinion). A straight black and white conversion may work better I think.</td>', 'I am not sure if the sepia toning works for this subject as sepia usually implies age (the building itself feels futuristic in my opinion). A straight black and white conversion may work better I think.', '2009-06-10 05:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522267, 797965, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little on the flat side. This needs some contrast adjustments</td>', 'A little on the flat side. This needs some contrast adjustments', '2009-06-10 05:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522269, 797785, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot but it needs some contrast adjustments to make it pop</td>', 'Not a bad shot but it needs some contrast adjustments to make it pop', '2009-06-10 05:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522275, 798102, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I feel like we are aren''t seeing enough of the structure.</td>', 'Great shot but I feel like we are aren''t seeing enough of the structure.', '2009-06-10 05:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522276, 797723, 66515, '<td valign="top">pretty much all the images look better bigger :)</td>', 'pretty much all the images look better bigger :)', '2009-06-10 05:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522278, 797829, 66515, '<td valign="top">That spot light is in an unfortunate spot. It can''t  be helped of course.</td>', 'That spot light is in an unfortunate spot. It can''t  be helped of course.', '2009-06-10 05:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522279, 797847, 66515, '<td valign="top">This image has potential however I feel the processing has marred it somewhat. Saturation was pushed too much and it looks oversharpened.</td>', 'This image has potential however I feel the processing has marred it somewhat. Saturation was pushed too much and it looks oversharpened.', '2009-06-10 05:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522281, 797260, 66515, '<td valign="top">A bit underexposed. Tough scene to shoot though. If this were only in advanced editing...</td>', 'A bit underexposed. Tough scene to shoot though. If this were only in advanced editing...', '2009-06-10 05:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522282, 798123, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great selective focus. Nice details picked up.</td>', 'Great selective focus. Nice details picked up.', '2009-06-10 05:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522283, 797770, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! The sci-fi escalators at odds with the archaic architecture. The place is just too weird. Like it was thrown together with elements from different eras. An excellent subject matter for the Duotones challenge too, perhaps? Good luck! :)</td>', 'Nicely done! The sci-fi escalators at odds with the archaic architecture. The place is just too weird. Like it was thrown together with elements from different eras. An excellent subject matter for the Duotones challenge too, perhaps? Good luck! :)', '2009-06-10 05:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
