(5522299, 797750, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the large border I am afraid. I find it something of a distraction. <br/> <br/>That aside I like the reflections on the floor and the cool colors.</td>', 'Not really fond of the large border I am afraid. I find it something of a distraction.  That aside I like the reflections on the floor and the cool colors.', '2009-06-10 06:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522300, 798049, 66515, '<td valign="top">When I shoot buildings I try to chose something to make completely vertical to help anchor the image. The vertical supports in the foreground would be a good candidate for this I think.<br/> <br/>I''d like to see this possibly without the trees in the foreground. The image would then have a nice monochrome look to it that you could work with.<br/>(Maybe not possible to get the whole bridge and get that close however).</td>', 'When I shoot buildings I try to chose something to make completely vertical to help anchor the image. The vertical supports in the foreground would be a good candidate for this I think. I''d like to see this possibly without the trees in the foreground. The image would then have a nice monochrome look to it that you could work with.(Maybe not possible to get the whole bridge and get that close however).', '2009-06-10 06:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5522301, 798032, 66515, '<td valign="top">not sure about the hue change (from blue to purple). Doesn''t hurt the image but it makes it kinda weird I think.</td>', 'not sure about the hue change (from blue to purple). Doesn''t hurt the image but it makes it kinda weird I think.', '2009-06-10 06:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
