(5524950, 797745, 99506, '<td valign="top">Definately better for architecture :) I love the subtle reflection and the way the straight lines contrast the gentle curve of the building. I tyhink that B&amp;W was a good call here as colour could have lead to us missing the subtleties.</td>', 'Definately better for architecture :) I love the subtle reflection and the way the straight lines contrast the gentle curve of the building. I tyhink that B&W was a good call here as colour could have lead to us missing the subtleties.', '2009-06-12 05:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5524953, 797093, 99506, '<td valign="top">This is simply outstanding. It just works, fantastic, love the blues the lines and the composition and the crop. 10 from  me.</td>', 'This is simply outstanding. It just works, fantastic, love the blues the lines and the composition and the crop. 10 from  me.', '2009-06-12 05:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5524954, 797842, 99506, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and the way the long time exposure has given the smoke a lovely soft flowing feel.<br/>I''m going to assume that top right are stars and not hot pixles lol.</td>', 'I really like this shot and the way the long time exposure has given the smoke a lovely soft flowing feel.I''m going to assume that top right are stars and not hot pixles lol.', '2009-06-12 05:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5524955, 797849, 99506, '<td valign="top">I love the subject and the composition, the way the windows reflect the blues in the sky and how it all contrasts with the deep orange/brown of the wood.<br/>However the whites seem a little blown out for me so I''m voting a 6.</td>', 'I love the subject and the composition, the way the windows reflect the blues in the sky and how it all contrasts with the deep orange/brown of the wood.However the whites seem a little blown out for me so I''m voting a 6.', '2009-06-12 05:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5524958, 797761, 99506, '<td valign="top">Lovely building and composition.<br/>I don''y know if you were using high ISO but it seem to have a great deal of noise and for me that distracts from the overall impact. 5 from me.</td>', 'Lovely building and composition.I don''y know if you were using high ISO but it seem to have a great deal of noise and for me that distracts from the overall impact. 5 from me.', '2009-06-12 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5524964, 798161, 99506, '<td valign="top">I love your image and I respect your bravery for risking this kind of shot on here.<br/>It works really well for me, the way the structure of the building works to divide the two types of sky. 7 from me.</td>', 'I love your image and I respect your bravery for risking this kind of shot on here.It works really well for me, the way the structure of the building works to divide the two types of sky. 7 from me.', '2009-06-12 05:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5524971, 797010, 99506, '<td valign="top">It must be very difficult to expose this correctly, bright whit building in bright sunshine, but you achieved it perfectly, good work</td>', 'It must be very difficult to expose this correctly, bright whit building in bright sunshine, but you achieved it perfectly, good work', '2009-06-12 05:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
