(5524998, 798147, 99506, '<td valign="top">This has too much of a snapshot feel IMO and I''m not keen on the vignetting. 4 from me sorry</td>', 'This has too much of a snapshot feel IMO and I''m not keen on the vignetting. 4 from me sorry', '2009-06-12 05:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
