(5525634, 797761, 24486, '<td valign="top">A very interesting looking building. I actually googled this to see what it is. I would say that you could spend quite a lot of time photographing this with different cropping but I like the choice you went with.</td>', 'A very interesting looking building. I actually googled this to see what it is. I would say that you could spend quite a lot of time photographing this with different cropping but I like the choice you went with.', '2009-06-12 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
