(5526427, 798162, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''d say this meets the challenge well.  It''s an interesting shot and this is non-typical architecture.  It looked a bit tilted even in the thumbnail.  Even though you used your 50mm lens there is some vertical distortion because of the angle of the shot, and it looks like it was straightened based on the left side of the silo.  Straightening based on the center bar may have balanced it more.</td>', 'I''d say this meets the challenge well.  It''s an interesting shot and this is non-typical architecture.  It looked a bit tilted even in the thumbnail.  Even though you used your 50mm lens there is some vertical distortion because of the angle of the shot, and it looks like it was straightened based on the left side of the silo.  Straightening based on the center bar may have balanced it more.', '2009-06-13 11:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
