(5527416, 797834, 86447, '<td valign="top">Back to bump this from an 8 to a 9.  (Is this Brent?)  It''s lovely... colors and processing are beautifully done.   AND you''ve add in an interesting composition.  Good stuff.</td>', 'Back to bump this from an 8 to a 9.  (Is this Brent?)  It''s lovely... colors and processing are beautifully done.   AND you''ve add in an interesting composition.  Good stuff.', '2009-06-14 11:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527420, 797828, 86447, '<td valign="top">This seems over processed to me.  I like the composition very much.  But, the image quality is too poor to score really well, I fear.   Look at the ceiling...    Still, there is much to be said for perfect composition.  You have ''the eye''.  :)</td>', 'This seems over processed to me.  I like the composition very much.  But, the image quality is too poor to score really well, I fear.   Look at the ceiling...    Still, there is much to be said for perfect composition.  You have ''the eye''.  :)', '2009-06-14 11:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527421, 798162, 86447, '<td valign="top">I feel a bit off-balance when I look at this.  When I mentally climb that leaning ladder...   And the contrast could be upped to give the image a bit more ''pop'', I think.</td>', 'I feel a bit off-balance when I look at this.  When I mentally climb that leaning ladder...   And the contrast could be upped to give the image a bit more ''pop'', I think.', '2009-06-14 11:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527497, 798140, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool shot and swirls in the background - but it seems to lack a bit of contrast and lighting on the front of the model to really jump out at us.</td>', 'cool shot and swirls in the background - but it seems to lack a bit of contrast and lighting on the front of the model to really jump out at us.', '2009-06-14 12:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527499, 797093, 67152, '<td valign="top">just awesome - i anticipate a ribbon for this one</td>', 'just awesome - i anticipate a ribbon for this one', '2009-06-14 12:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527501, 797882, 67152, '<td valign="top">well seen and delivered - the shadows, the slopes and curve and intersecting lines</td>', 'well seen and delivered - the shadows, the slopes and curve and intersecting lines', '2009-06-14 12:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527571, 797260, 86218, '<td valign="top">Really love what you did here. I acnt decide however if the empty space works for this or not or if closer human placing in this space would have worked. Gave it a 7 for this but feel I shoudl rate it higher. Still a shot with impact fro me.</td>', 'Really love what you did here. I acnt decide however if the empty space works for this or not or if closer human placing in this space would have worked. Gave it a 7 for this but feel I shoudl rate it higher. Still a shot with impact fro me.', '2009-06-14 14:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527600, 797285, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice work well presented</td>', 'Nice work well presented', '2009-06-14 14:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527603, 797626, 86218, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity of this shot with sky working well. Is the person in pic sharp? Lines look a little soft but still a nice shot and well seen.</td>', 'Love the simplicity of this shot with sky working well. Is the person in pic sharp? Lines look a little soft but still a nice shot and well seen.', '2009-06-14 14:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527605, 798138, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines.Exposure seems a bit off here and for that reason and sharpness lacking I gave a bit less than this pic actually deserves. Still one that caught my eye</td>', 'Very nice lines.Exposure seems a bit off here and for that reason and sharpness lacking I gave a bit less than this pic actually deserves. Still one that caught my eye', '2009-06-14 14:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527629, 796557, 43565, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like the building is bleeding!</td>', 'It almost looks like the building is bleeding!', '2009-06-14 15:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527721, 797849, 106653, '<td valign="top">great composition</td>', 'great composition', '2009-06-14 17:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527775, 797423, 60899, '<td valign="top">Too thick border ..6</td>', 'Too thick border ..6', '2009-06-14 18:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527818, 797196, 79602, '<td valign="top">Love the light vs. dark and the swirling clouds.  Great shot!</td>', 'Love the light vs. dark and the swirling clouds.  Great shot!', '2009-06-14 19:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527820, 797522, 79602, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really neat place, but the washed out sky really takes away from the photo.  Maybe moving closer to get the details of the building would have been better...</td>', 'This looks like a really neat place, but the washed out sky really takes away from the photo.  Maybe moving closer to get the details of the building would have been better...', '2009-06-14 19:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527823, 798005, 79602, '<td valign="top">I love the LB blur and colors.  Great isolation of the building!</td>', 'I love the LB blur and colors.  Great isolation of the building!', '2009-06-14 19:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527825, 796584, 79602, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors...</td>', 'Incredible colors...', '2009-06-14 19:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527826, 797750, 79602, '<td valign="top">Awesome reflections!</td>', 'Awesome reflections!', '2009-06-14 19:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527828, 797093, 79602, '<td valign="top">Incredible lines and photo treatment! A 10 from me...</td>', 'Incredible lines and photo treatment! A 10 from me...', '2009-06-14 19:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527833, 798155, 79602, '<td valign="top">The architecture and sky are really incredible!  This makes me want to run out and purchase a fisheye lens.  I wish the darkest areas were a little bit brighter, but I still love the photo...</td>', 'The architecture and sky are really incredible!  This makes me want to run out and purchase a fisheye lens.  I wish the darkest areas were a little bit brighter, but I still love the photo...', '2009-06-14 19:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527836, 797011, 79602, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors and lighting!</td>', 'Awesome colors and lighting!', '2009-06-14 19:20:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5527839, 797378, 79602, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet intriguing.  I really like the overall blue tones...</td>', 'Simple, yet intriguing.  I really like the overall blue tones...', '2009-06-14 19:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527841, 797867, 79602, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat idea!  The photo itself could use some contrast, as it looks a bit washed out.  It might have helped to burn in the eye area a little to make the building within pop...</td>', 'This is a really neat idea!  The photo itself could use some contrast, as it looks a bit washed out.  It might have helped to burn in the eye area a little to make the building within pop...', '2009-06-14 19:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527846, 798161, 79602, '<td valign="top">The Arch is always fun to shoot, but difficult to make creative, since it''s been done so many times before (me included). I love the simplicity along with the great cloud.  Nice B&amp;W conversion as well...</td>', 'The Arch is always fun to shoot, but difficult to make creative, since it''s been done so many times before (me included). I love the simplicity along with the great cloud.  Nice B&W conversion as well...', '2009-06-14 19:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527852, 798032, 79602, '<td valign="top">The building looks incredible, but the sky and parts of the building look a bit too unnatural with the purplish cast...</td>', 'The building looks incredible, but the sky and parts of the building look a bit too unnatural with the purplish cast...', '2009-06-14 19:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527862, 797653, 79602, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a cool place!  Love the comp and the people added for interest and scale...</td>', 'Wow, what a cool place!  Love the comp and the people added for interest and scale...', '2009-06-14 19:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527865, 797834, 79602, '<td valign="top">Now this is a fascinating mix of lighting and colors.  Great composition - one of my favorites!</td>', 'Now this is a fascinating mix of lighting and colors.  Great composition - one of my favorites!', '2009-06-14 19:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527867, 797831, 79602, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but the darkened church top (from a graduated filter?) really detracts...</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but the darkened church top (from a graduated filter?) really detracts...', '2009-06-14 19:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5527964, 797882, 16929, '<td valign="top">8 for 8.</td>', '8 for 8.', '2009-06-14 21:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528043, 797239, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. I think a higher angle would have helped -- less ground would have allowed the antennae (pl?) to clear the frame.</td>', 'Nicely composed. I think a higher angle would have helped -- less ground would have allowed the antennae (pl?) to clear the frame.', '2009-06-14 22:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528044, 797047, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Very appealing colors.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Very appealing colors.', '2009-06-14 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528045, 797491, 76335, '<td valign="top">Might have worked better in black and white and maybe it a different time of day with more flattering lighting. Still nicely composed.</td>', 'Might have worked better in black and white and maybe it a different time of day with more flattering lighting. Still nicely composed.', '2009-06-14 22:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528049, 797745, 76335, '<td valign="top">Certainly architecture. Still, this needs some more contrast and perhaps backing up to show us more of the structure.</td>', 'Certainly architecture. Still, this needs some more contrast and perhaps backing up to show us more of the structure.', '2009-06-14 22:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528050, 797049, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good long exposure work. Might have moved in closer. The police sign along the right doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'Good long exposure work. Might have moved in closer. The police sign along the right doesn''t add anything.', '2009-06-14 22:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528051, 798138, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract presentation, but it''s hard to see from your composition that this is architecture. Abstract is good, but a little more context would have helped in this case.</td>', 'Nice abstract presentation, but it''s hard to see from your composition that this is architecture. Abstract is good, but a little more context would have helped in this case.', '2009-06-14 22:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528053, 797022, 76335, '<td valign="top">The tilt is a little extreme and I''m not sure what it''s buying you.</td>', 'The tilt is a little extreme and I''m not sure what it''s buying you.', '2009-06-14 22:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528061, 798036, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little too sharp maybe -- most apparent in the overexposed areas of sun beaming in. Nicely coposed all the same.</td>', 'A little too sharp maybe -- most apparent in the overexposed areas of sun beaming in. Nicely coposed all the same.', '2009-06-14 22:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528064, 798165, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, though I wonder if too much detail is lost in the shadows.</td>', 'I like the lighting, though I wonder if too much detail is lost in the shadows.', '2009-06-14 22:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528066, 797011, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.</td>', 'Fabulous.', '2009-06-14 22:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528067, 797218, 76335, '<td valign="top">Exposure is perfect. Very abstract. I wonder how it would look in BW.</td>', 'Exposure is perfect. Very abstract. I wonder how it would look in BW.', '2009-06-14 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528068, 797368, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great use of BW to show off all those patterns.</td>', 'Great use of BW to show off all those patterns.', '2009-06-14 22:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528069, 798039, 76335, '<td valign="top">The framing is good, but this might have worked better in black and white.<br/> <br/>ETA: Actually, I think this could work in color -- side lighting and more gentle sun perhaps?</td>', 'The framing is good, but this might have worked better in black and white. ETA: Actually, I think this could work in color -- side lighting and more gentle sun perhaps?', '2009-06-14 22:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528070, 798140, 76335, '<td valign="top">Original take on the challenge.</td>', 'Original take on the challenge.', '2009-06-14 22:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528078, 797716, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting here. Hard to believe you didn''t use HDR or dodge and burn.</td>', 'Fabulous lighting here. Hard to believe you didn''t use HDR or dodge and burn.', '2009-06-14 22:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528079, 797962, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is really good. A little more contrast and/or a little more brightness on the right side (it''s kind of dark) would have helped a lot.</td>', 'This is really good. A little more contrast and/or a little more brightness on the right side (it''s kind of dark) would have helped a lot.', '2009-06-14 22:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528080, 798051, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. I froze my rear end off there a couple Thanksgiving''s ago -- I think it even snowed (?).<br/> <br/>ETA: Okay, I''ve thought about it some more. I think backing off and giving us more of the large scale form and structure and less of the nostalgic detail would have helped. As I said in my PM, the title doesn''t help to that end. The side lighting is good, but not from this angle. Almost half the frame (left side) is in the shadows really. The colors you did capture, however, are beautiful. The blue sky against the gold is most appealing. <br/> <br/>And <a href="//www.dallasnews.com/sharedcontent/dws/dn/latestnews/stories/112207dnmetsnow.2be38fbc.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">it did snow that year</a>!</td>', 'Nicely lit. I froze my rear end off there a couple Thanksgiving''s ago -- I think it even snowed (?). ETA: Okay, I''ve thought about it some more. I think backing off and giving us more of the large scale form and structure and less of the nostalgic detail would have helped. As I said in my PM, the title doesn''t help to that end. The side lighting is good, but not from this angle. Almost half the frame (left side) is in the shadows really. The colors you did capture, however, are beautiful. The blue sky against the gold is most appealing.  And it did snow that year!', '2009-06-14 22:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528081, 797829, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very grand, good sense of scale, lots of detail, and the exposure is perfect. I especially love the camera man in motion on the stage.</td>', 'Very grand, good sense of scale, lots of detail, and the exposure is perfect. I especially love the camera man in motion on the stage.', '2009-06-14 22:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528082, 797680, 76335, '<td valign="top">This one has rhythm and great geometry. The color, I thought, was a bit much, but they are warm and appealing -- good light. I think it''s a bit too sharp though, and I''m not sure about the billboard (words) along the left.</td>', 'This one has rhythm and great geometry. The color, I thought, was a bit much, but they are warm and appealing -- good light. I think it''s a bit too sharp though, and I''m not sure about the billboard (words) along the left.', '2009-06-14 22:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528083, 797750, 76335, '<td valign="top">You''ve lost me with the border. Otherwise, a nice space.</td>', 'You''ve lost me with the border. Otherwise, a nice space.', '2009-06-14 22:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528085, 798123, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lensbaby? No matter. Well done.</td>', 'Lensbaby? No matter. Well done.', '2009-06-14 22:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528086, 797841, 76335, '<td valign="top">A stretch for the challenge, but I love pylons, so I''ll thrown an extra point your way.</td>', 'A stretch for the challenge, but I love pylons, so I''ll thrown an extra point your way.', '2009-06-14 22:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528089, 797168, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like a high ISO shot. I think noise reduction would have killed it. Still, beautifully composed and exposed.</td>', 'Looks like a high ISO shot. I think noise reduction would have killed it. Still, beautifully composed and exposed.', '2009-06-14 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528090, 798000, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous symmetry, beautifully abstract. (eyewave?)</td>', 'Fabulous symmetry, beautifully abstract. (eyewave?)', '2009-06-14 22:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528091, 797192, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great, well, lines and curves. I like your processing also.</td>', 'Great, well, lines and curves. I like your processing also.', '2009-06-14 22:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528092, 796852, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good but screams for black and white. The color doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Good but screams for black and white. The color doesn''t do much for me.', '2009-06-14 22:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528093, 797285, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the POV here. Great sky too.</td>', 'I love the POV here. Great sky too.', '2009-06-14 22:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528094, 797696, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting color and detail. Well composed and framed. A little more DOF might have brought out more detail on the upper steps.</td>', 'Interesting color and detail. Well composed and framed. A little more DOF might have brought out more detail on the upper steps.', '2009-06-14 22:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528096, 797295, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. Nicely composed. Would have made a wonderful high contrast black and white, but nothing''s lost in this color version.</td>', 'Fabulous. Nicely composed. Would have made a wonderful high contrast black and white, but nothing''s lost in this color version.', '2009-06-14 22:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528097, 798161, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully minimalist.</td>', 'Wonderfully minimalist.', '2009-06-14 22:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528098, 796584, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great colors here.</td>', 'Great colors here.', '2009-06-14 22:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528099, 797842, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure. Warm, appealing colors and lots of great geometry.</td>', 'Nice long exposure. Warm, appealing colors and lots of great geometry.', '2009-06-14 22:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528100, 798133, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully exposed to show off some great forms and colors.</td>', 'Beautifully exposed to show off some great forms and colors.', '2009-06-14 22:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528101, 797902, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and framed. The lighting isn''t terrribly flattering to my eyes. Also the colors seem slightly off and there''s noise. Maybe a tripod and a longer exposure would have helped.</td>', 'Nicely composed and framed. The lighting isn''t terrribly flattering to my eyes. Also the colors seem slightly off and there''s noise. Maybe a tripod and a longer exposure would have helped.', '2009-06-14 22:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528102, 797714, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great abstract presentation.</td>', 'Great abstract presentation.', '2009-06-14 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528103, 797849, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great shapes, but I think some side lighting, if possible, would have shown them off to greater effect.</td>', 'Great shapes, but I think some side lighting, if possible, would have shown them off to greater effect.', '2009-06-14 22:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528104, 797709, 76335, '<td valign="top">Funky. I took me a second, but I like the negative space.</td>', 'Funky. I took me a second, but I like the negative space.', '2009-06-14 22:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528105, 798032, 76335, '<td valign="top">The purple is a little unrealistic. Otherwise, great angle, very grand presentation. I love the contrail.</td>', 'The purple is a little unrealistic. Otherwise, great angle, very grand presentation. I love the contrail.', '2009-06-14 22:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528106, 797933, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great structure, greater title!</td>', 'Great structure, greater title!', '2009-06-14 22:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528107, 797653, 76335, '<td valign="top">Almost missed the two conversing figures. Great!</td>', 'Almost missed the two conversing figures. Great!', '2009-06-14 22:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528108, 797063, 76335, '<td valign="top">Original idea, nicely composed.</td>', 'Original idea, nicely composed.', '2009-06-14 22:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528109, 797088, 76335, '<td valign="top">Colors strike me as a bit strong, but I''m probably the only one. Nicely framed otherwise. Great patterns.</td>', 'Colors strike me as a bit strong, but I''m probably the only one. Nicely framed otherwise. Great patterns.', '2009-06-14 22:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528111, 797770, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice panoramic presentation. Those blues and golds work really well together.</td>', 'Nice panoramic presentation. Those blues and golds work really well together.', '2009-06-14 22:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528113, 797152, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is such a great photo!!</td>', 'Wow. This is such a great photo!!', '2009-06-14 22:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528114, 797378, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is really good. The cool colors, the dramatic lighting. Lots of great metaphors here...</td>', 'This is really good. The cool colors, the dramatic lighting. Lots of great metaphors here...', '2009-06-14 22:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528115, 797992, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice rotunda. Strong enough on its own; the border doesn''t add anything for me. In fact, I thought it was a stray cable or line in the scene at first.</td>', 'Nice rotunda. Strong enough on its own; the border doesn''t add anything for me. In fact, I thought it was a stray cable or line in the scene at first.', '2009-06-14 22:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528116, 798012, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice. The sepia and grain (noise?) are really effective.</td>', 'Nice. The sepia and grain (noise?) are really effective.', '2009-06-14 22:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528117, 797772, 76335, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like something out of a fairy tale. Very cool.</td>', 'Almost looks like something out of a fairy tale. Very cool.', '2009-06-14 22:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528118, 798155, 76335, '<td valign="top">I almost got through all the shots without the token fisheye entry! This is good though, and it works well in black and white. Wish I could see just a little more detail in the buildings.</td>', 'I almost got through all the shots without the token fisheye entry! This is good though, and it works well in black and white. Wish I could see just a little more detail in the buildings.', '2009-06-14 22:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528119, 798121, 76335, '<td valign="top">Convincing point of view and nicely exposed.</td>', 'Convincing point of view and nicely exposed.', '2009-06-14 22:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528120, 797561, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and action, but not really about the architecture.<br/> <br/>ETA: I do love the geometry here. Very nicely composed. I''m bumping it a point, though I still think any architecture is secondary to the composition.</td>', 'Nice shapes and action, but not really about the architecture. ETA: I do love the geometry here. Very nicely composed. I''m bumping it a point, though I still think any architecture is secondary to the composition.', '2009-06-14 22:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528121, 797634, 100831, '<td valign="top">I hope this does well. Love it..</td>', 'I hope this does well. Love it..', '2009-06-14 22:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528122, 796584, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and rich colo. Nicely framed - great work</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and rich colo. Nicely framed - great work', '2009-06-14 22:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528123, 796964, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nicely done sounds kind of boring for this... but it is.</td>', 'Nicely done sounds kind of boring for this... but it is.', '2009-06-14 22:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528124, 798005, 100831, '<td valign="top">very cool color processing and the blur works well.</td>', 'very cool color processing and the blur works well.', '2009-06-14 22:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528125, 797649, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very abstract. Nice deep blues and good contrast.</td>', 'Very abstract. Nice deep blues and good contrast.', '2009-06-14 22:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528126, 796930, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very busy. Too many distractions are taking away from the structure. This looks like a great building but short of letting the lady pass and maybe waiting until some of the parked cars left, I don''t see how you could have composed it any better from this vantage point. Maybe move in a little closer?</td>', 'Very busy. Too many distractions are taking away from the structure. This looks like a great building but short of letting the lady pass and maybe waiting until some of the parked cars left, I don''t see how you could have composed it any better from this vantage point. Maybe move in a little closer?', '2009-06-14 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528127, 797467, 76335, '<td valign="top">The colors pull the eye from the structure.</td>', 'The colors pull the eye from the structure.', '2009-06-14 22:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528128, 797982, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great structure, but it looks oversharpened.</td>', 'Great structure, but it looks oversharpened.', '2009-06-14 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528129, 797093, 100831, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Excellent geometry, in an abstract kind of way - love the composition!! 9</td>', 'Very cool. Excellent geometry, in an abstract kind of way - love the composition!! 9', '2009-06-14 22:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528132, 797634, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like what you were after, but it needs to be much sharper. A faster shutter speed is necessary, I think. Even then, I''m not sure the photo would be primarily about architecture.</td>', 'I like what you were after, but it needs to be much sharper. A faster shutter speed is necessary, I think. Even then, I''m not sure the photo would be primarily about architecture.', '2009-06-14 22:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5528133, 797963, 76335, '<td valign="top">Needs some color balance work. The building is too green.</td>', 'Needs some color balance work. The building is too green.', '2009-06-14 22:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
