(5531395, 797520, 77192, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you photographed this as it "grabbed you", and that''s a very personal thing. I''m afraid it doesn''t grab me though. Sorry.<br/> <br/>[That sounded really harsh when I re-read that and I honestly didn''t mean it to. I guess I''m just trying to say we each have unique sensibilities and tastes. I would expect your picture to be really liked by a fair few people, just not me :-(  ]</td>', 'I''m assuming you photographed this as it "grabbed you", and that''s a very personal thing. I''m afraid it doesn''t grab me though. Sorry. [That sounded really harsh when I re-read that and I honestly didn''t mean it to. I guess I''m just trying to say we each have unique sensibilities and tastes. I would expect your picture to be really liked by a fair few people, just not me :-(  ]', '2009-06-16 15:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5531400, 798102, 77192, '<td valign="top">Lovely silhouette. I''d like to see it from a different angle where the hills don''t get in the way so much.</td>', 'Lovely silhouette. I''d like to see it from a different angle where the hills don''t get in the way so much.', '2009-06-16 15:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
