(5531515, 796964, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, shame the weather wasn''t better for you I imagine this could have been stunning with a nice low sun.</td>', 'Nice perspective, shame the weather wasn''t better for you I imagine this could have been stunning with a nice low sun.', '2009-06-16 16:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
