(5531566, 797867, 106484, '<td valign="top">Really great idea, although it isn''t as sharp as it could be. If this was tack sharp it would be fantastic.</td>', 'Really great idea, although it isn''t as sharp as it could be. If this was tack sharp it would be fantastic.', '2009-06-16 17:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
