(5532072, 797285, 13749, '<td valign="top">I definitely like the composition here, but don''t personally care for the border here.  I won''t let that affect my scoring here, but have a feeling it may have pulled you down a little bit.</td>', 'I definitely like the composition here, but don''t personally care for the border here.  I won''t let that affect my scoring here, but have a feeling it may have pulled you down a little bit.', '2009-06-16 23:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
