(5532197, 797725, 83313, '<td valign="top">A unique perspective. Might just need a little tweaking of curves to give it some more visual oomph.</td>', 'A unique perspective. Might just need a little tweaking of curves to give it some more visual oomph.', '2009-06-17 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532202, 798005, 83313, '<td valign="top">A neat effect. I like it.</td>', 'A neat effect. I like it.', '2009-06-17 00:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532206, 798162, 83313, '<td valign="top">Never thought of a steel silo as architecture. I''ll be curious to see how this fares.</td>', 'Never thought of a steel silo as architecture. I''ll be curious to see how this fares.', '2009-06-17 00:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532215, 797010, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit of haloing around the edge of the sky and building. I''ve gotten nailed for that a few times myself. It''s a fine line to walk when trying to give it some "wow" under basic rules.</td>', 'A bit of haloing around the edge of the sky and building. I''ve gotten nailed for that a few times myself. It''s a fine line to walk when trying to give it some "wow" under basic rules.', '2009-06-17 00:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532227, 797690, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch your JPEG compression when you save, I can see some artifacts around the edges of the turrets. With a 97k file size, you had a lot more overhead and could have used less compression on this.</td>', 'Watch your JPEG compression when you save, I can see some artifacts around the edges of the turrets. With a 97k file size, you had a lot more overhead and could have used less compression on this.', '2009-06-17 00:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532238, 797887, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a lack of sharpness and detail to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. There are lots of artifacts visible around the edges and details of the tower. Your file size of only 20k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'There is a lack of sharpness and detail to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. There are lots of artifacts visible around the edges and details of the tower. Your file size of only 20k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-06-17 00:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532244, 797734, 83313, '<td valign="top">This shot seems soft and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 62k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'This shot seems soft and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 62k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-06-17 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
