(5534686, 797867, 104220, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments, the more the better.<br/> <br/>There was ONE comment in which I was screamed at for<br/>the image having no architectural value...??? Well we<br/>have different tastes and I am sure that no matter how<br/>good or BAD a picture is, it is bound to inspire someone<br/>else at some point - Isn''t that what it''s all about..???<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all your comments, the more the better. There was ONE comment in which I was screamed at forthe image having no architectural value...??? Well wehave different tastes and I am sure that no matter howgood or BAD a picture is, it is bound to inspire someoneelse at some point - Isn''t that what it''s all about..??? ', '2009-06-18 09:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
