(5535830, 798000, 85102, '<td valign="top">Great shot. It''s funny because I went to the Milwaukee Museum of Art and I remember thinking, wow this is incredible, what a great picture it would make. I think another person also shot it for DPChallange and ribboned. Clearly, I wasn''t the only one who thought that...<br/> <br/>Nicely done! :D</td>', 'Great shot. It''s funny because I went to the Milwaukee Museum of Art and I remember thinking, wow this is incredible, what a great picture it would make. I think another person also shot it for DPChallange and ribboned. Clearly, I wasn''t the only one who thought that... Nicely done! :D', '2009-06-18 23:55:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5535903, 797378, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>I love the luminous cool blues, the layered composition, and the moody mystery that draws me in....</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!I love the luminous cool blues, the layered composition, and the moody mystery that draws me in....', '2009-06-19 00:56:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5535907, 796584, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>luminous, beautiful tones, color, textures and form--well done!</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!luminous, beautiful tones, color, textures and form--well done!', '2009-06-19 00:57:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5535917, 798005, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>This is Fantastic.  Real Abstract Reality--and the lensbaby choices you made (aperture, sweet spot, etc) are such enhancements to this wonderfully disorienting surreal image.  This is fascinating.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!This is Fantastic.  Real Abstract Reality--and the lensbaby choices you made (aperture, sweet spot, etc) are such enhancements to this wonderfully disorienting surreal image.  This is fascinating.', '2009-06-19 01:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5535921, 798158, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I have to confess I was a little surprised this did not score higher.  I thought it was a pretty strong image for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Composition is good, it includes just the right balance of "busy-ness".<br/> <br/>One comment I would make is that the image doesn''t feel really, really sharp, but looking at your EXIF I can see that maybe a product of the 1600 ISO a relatively slow shutter speed.  Without any image stabilisation it is difficult to get things tack sharp at less than 1/60.<br/> <br/>Overall, I really like this image and am still surprised it did not score higher.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club I have to confess I was a little surprised this did not score higher.  I thought it was a pretty strong image for this challenge. Composition is good, it includes just the right balance of "busy-ness". One comment I would make is that the image doesn''t feel really, really sharp, but looking at your EXIF I can see that maybe a product of the 1600 ISO a relatively slow shutter speed.  Without any image stabilisation it is difficult to get things tack sharp at less than 1/60. Overall, I really like this image and am still surprised it did not score higher.', '2009-06-19 01:01:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5536086, 796645, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  What the heck is he doing?</td>', 'Very cool!  What the heck is he doing?', '2009-06-19 05:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5536328, 797093, 31664, '<td valign="top">WOW! beautiful composition and creative uses of available tools to produce a stunning image,  a well deserved ribbon. Congratulations.</td>', 'WOW! beautiful composition and creative uses of available tools to produce a stunning image,  a well deserved ribbon. Congratulations.', '2009-06-19 10:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
